<title>USA: CNA Financial, Capsure form surety company.</title>
<headline>CNA Financial, Capsure form surety company.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Financial Corp and Capsure Holdings Corp Thursday announced a definitive agreement to form a new stock company, CNA Surety Corp, which will be the largest surety company in the United States.</p>
<p>On a pro forma basis, CNA Surety Corp's net written premiums for the 12 months ended September 30, 1996 would total $232.8 million of a total surety market of $2.7 billion, making it 30 percent larger than the next largest U.S. surety operation.</p>
</text>
